      "title": "DNS: Add to Responsible authority's mailbox field",
      "message": "DNS: Add to Responsible authority's mailbox field\n\nThe field should be treated as if it's encoded <local-part>@<mail-domain>, so create a generated field with that formatting\n\nFixes #20256\n",
